-- **Build Company ship in two successes:** first place a partially built Company ship in the Governor's region; if already one there, a subsequent successful Build completes it into the sea zone associated with the Governor's President. The partially built ship has no other effect.
-- **Commission regiment:** add it to the Army associated with the Governor's President. It functions as officer for strength, pays loot to bank and does not roll officer losses.
